(Portfolio 1: Database Design and Modelling) Tj
0 -22 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(The relational design uses four core tables with primary keys, foreign keys, and checks that enforce business rules. A customer may have at most one active basket and product records are linked to orders through valid item entries.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(The design also shows the relationships between customer, product, order, order item, and review entities. This keeps the data normalized and supports reliable querying.) Tj
