(Portfolio 5: Distributed and Cloud Database Exercise) Tj
0 -22 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Three MongoDB replica members were proposed across separate failure zones. This covered elections, majority acknowledgement, secondary lag, and sharding trade-offs for order_events.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(The design demonstrates how durability and availability can be balanced in distributed systems.) Tj
